 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.56,
   "text": "You don't need more willpower to stop checking your phone, you need more distance."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.06,
   "e": 6.2,
   "text": "When it's on your desk, checking it takes one second,"
  },
  {
   "s": 6.5,
   "e": 9.22,
   "text": "so your hand gets there before you've even decided to."
  },
  {
   "s": 9.6,
   "e": 13.18,
   "text": "So for your first focused block, put your phone in another room and close the door,"
  },
  {
   "s": 13.8,
   "e": 16.38,
   "text": "then set a timer on your laptop for 25 minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": 16.8,
   "e": 19.66,
   "text": "Now checking it means standing up and walking away from your work,"
  },
  {
   "s": 20.04,
   "e": 23.08,
   "text": "and that small pause is usually enough to keep you on the task."
  },
  {
   "s": 23.54,
   "e": 28.16,
   "text": "Studying one chapter phone in the kitchen, writing a report, the first page phone in the bedroom."
  },
  {
   "s": 28.16,
   "e": 30.34,
   "text": "When the timer ends, take 5 minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": 30.92,
   "e": 32.82,
   "text": "Check whatever you want, then start the next block."
  },
  {
   "s": 33.34,
   "e": 36.04,
   "text": "So before your next block, pick the room your phone goes to."
  },
  {
   "s": 36.54,
   "e": 39.06,
   "text": "One closed door does more than willpower ever will."
  },
  {
   "s": 39.62,
   "e": 40.92,
   "text": "That's what Demure is for."
  },
  {
   "s": 41.32,
   "e": 43.78,
   "text": "You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "s": 43.78,
   "e": 46.6,
   "text": "and break it down into small steps you can actually do."
  },
  {
   "s": 46.96,
   "e": 49.5,
   "text": "If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
